      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 5_000_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.058\n    loan_term_years = 10\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the monthly mortgage repayment\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** (-total_payments))\n    )\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(monthly_payment, 3)\n```",
